[{:db/id "q-38705/selection/829e225c2606224a460523123d4d4b863180ec88b55f1a19a3f38b164ddf3732" :answer/id #uuid "8204610c-8297-5f5e-a28f-e060f549400c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12A-16I" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38705/selection/c159991c5079bce4baac9247aa400e272a0e1e873efdcddfdfbd4e3c934326ee" :answer/id #uuid "d20e6c30-429b-57a9-a623-22ef4976599c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2A+6I" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38705/selection/25a1066b67b7d19a877e7c8f327bc58f26ccb1255856da63360a8db86bc8a7e0" :answer/id #uuid "8f4e5ff7-e5cc-533c-969e-4ccd1b2237a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12A+16I" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38705/selection/df64f8da448801f8fb9a564fb2cfe2c001d2e5fe700a8379b912221c7524cc8a" :answer/id #uuid "381b3feb-4fe1-52f1-9017-34bc0b08d4f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2A+I" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38705/selection/ce09fdbafd8867b6da31454e69a96ed94fd6269dbb5be7314a236c90639dd609" :answer/id #uuid "49cc11cf-2d4f-5671-a802-b16f2aef160b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16A-12I" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38705/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "800a0099-1ff2-5ceb-afe7-173cdf1dc52f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-38705/selection/25a1066b67b7d19a877e7c8f327bc58f26ccb1255856da63360a8db86bc8a7e0" :answer-field/choices ["q-38705/selection/829e225c2606224a460523123d4d4b863180ec88b55f1a19a3f38b164ddf3732" "q-38705/selection/c159991c5079bce4baac9247aa400e272a0e1e873efdcddfdfbd4e3c934326ee" "q-38705/selection/25a1066b67b7d19a877e7c8f327bc58f26ccb1255856da63360a8db86bc8a7e0" "q-38705/selection/df64f8da448801f8fb9a564fb2cfe2c001d2e5fe700a8379b912221c7524cc8a" "q-38705/selection/ce09fdbafd8867b6da31454e69a96ed94fd6269dbb5be7314a236c90639dd609"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-38705" :question/id #uuid "b8267e9e-8ead-5bd0-9650-b3898b28bfc5" :question/math-academy-id "q-38705" :question/problem "If $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix $A$ with characteristic polynomial $p(x)={x}^{2}-2x-8,$ then ${A}^{3}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's divide the polynomial $f(x)={x}^{3}$ by characteristic polynomial $p(x)={x}^{2}-2x-8,$ using long division:\n\n|  | $\\,\\,x$ | $+$ | $2$ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${x}^{2}-2x-8\\,$ | $\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{{x}^{3}\\,\\,}$ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | ${x}^{3}$ | $-$ | $2{x}^{2}$ | $-$ | $8x$ |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  |  | $2{x}^{2}$ | $+$ | $8x$ |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  |  | $2{x}^{2}$ | $-$ | $4x$ | $-$ | $16$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  |  |  |  | $12x$ | $+$ | $16$ |  |  |  |  |\n\nTherefore, we can write ${x}^{3}$ as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{3} & =q(x)p(x)+(12x+16),\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $q(x)=x+2.$  Replacing $x$ with $A,$ we have\n\n$$\n{A}^{3}=q(A)p(A)+(12A+16I).\n$$\n\nNow, according to the Cayley-Hamilton theorem, we have $p(A)=O.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{3} & =q(A)p(A)+(12A+16I) \\\\  & =q(A)\\cdot O+(12A+16I) \\\\  & =12A+16I.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-38705/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "787173e1-f957-5ff0-9d14-a6ccb11de1d8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-38705"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-38723"] :question/problem "Let $A$ be a $3\\times 3$ matrix with the characteristic polynomial $p(\\lambda )=-{\\lambda }^{3}-2\\lambda -1.$ Then, ${A}^{3}=$" :question/worked-solution "Using the Cayley-Hamilton theorem, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p(A) & =O \\\\ -{A}^{3}-2A-I & =O \\\\ {A}^{3} & =-2A-I.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-38728/selection/ceada9ba989557dde2a27a39d37215d51f259d57537551fa236e5f0466b9ff45" :answer/id #uuid "bdcd3035-168f-5d50-93ab-043dc6373700" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-22 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 18\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38728/selection/8e449cc17cf35d307fce9561baebb237a848d9fe12bf980625da4c4c2baa5f52" :answer/id #uuid "b3b3a671-a720-5cf1-9028-05d42dcc7a31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -22 \\\\ 6 & 18\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38728/selection/88d809b99eb394a16ac2d16510d6538262d15a2392f7d0382dca4e107f55e713" :answer/id #uuid "fc299d90-000e-50ee-bbd1-d1585983c19f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-12 & -22 \\\\ 6 & 12\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38728/selection/a0d7ad83a5b05458077c8a7ee2840393cd34683cd6518247ec625a291db4c620" :answer/id #uuid "57851f5c-54c8-56d8-acd2-67503e02eeb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -22 \\\\ 18 & 6\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38728/selection/576e58436f2ada7c88a34ec938db685a187313ca41772061c9238ef42772422b" :answer/id #uuid "4f3c81fc-033e-51ba-b526-ae616d892ff1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}18 & -22 \\\\ 6 & -6\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38728/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f63e164a-d595-58e8-92fb-306fad4dbacc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-38728/selection/8e449cc17cf35d307fce9561baebb237a848d9fe12bf980625da4c4c2baa5f52" :answer-field/choices ["q-38728/selection/ceada9ba989557dde2a27a39d37215d51f259d57537551fa236e5f0466b9ff45" "q-38728/selection/8e449cc17cf35d307fce9561baebb237a848d9fe12bf980625da4c4c2baa5f52" "q-38728/selection/88d809b99eb394a16ac2d16510d6538262d15a2392f7d0382dca4e107f55e713" "q-38728/selection/a0d7ad83a5b05458077c8a7ee2840393cd34683cd6518247ec625a291db4c620" "q-38728/selection/576e58436f2ada7c88a34ec938db685a187313ca41772061c9238ef42772422b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-38728" :question/id #uuid "4c6e1cb3-d3e5-5ac7-9b61-9f6c0c45ae57" :question/math-academy-id "q-38728" :question/problem "Given the matrix\n$\\,A=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 11 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{aligned}]$\nand $f(x)={x}^{15}-3{x}^{13}+{x}^{3}-5x+6$, find $f(A).$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by finding the characteristic polynomial $p(\\lambda )$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p(\\lambda ) & =\\text{det}(A-\\lambda I) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}6-\\lambda  & 11 \\\\ -3 & -6-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(6-\\lambda )(-6-\\lambda )+33 \\\\  & ={\\lambda }^{2}-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's divide $f(x)$ by $p(x)$ using long division:\n\n|  | $\\,\\,{x}^{13}$ | $+$ | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${x}^{2}-3\\,$ | $\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{{x}^{15}-3{x}^{13}+{x}^{3}-5x+6}$ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | ${x}^{15}$ | $\\,\\,\\,\\,-$ | $\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{13}$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  |  |  | ${x}^{3}\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$ | $-\\,\\,$ | $\\,\\,5x$ | $\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,+$ | $\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6$ |\n|  |  |  |  | ${x}^{3}\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$ | $-\\,\\,$ | $\\,\\,3x$ |  |  |\n|  |  |  |  |  | $-\\,\\,$ | $\\,\\,2x$ | $\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,+$ | $\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6$ |\n\nTherefore, we can write $f(x)$ as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =q(x)p(x)+r(x) \\\\  & =q(x)p(x)+(-2x+6)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $q(x)={x}^{13}+x.$ Replacing $x$ with $A,$ we have\n\n$$\nf(A)=q(A)p(A)+(-2A+6I).\n$$\n\nAccording to the Cayley-Hamilton theorem, we have $p(A)=O.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(A) & =q(A)p(A)+(-2A+6I) \\\\  & =q(A)\\cdot O+(-2A+6I) \\\\  & =-2A+6I \\\\  & =-2[\\begin{aligned}6 & 11 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{aligned}]+6[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-12 & -22 \\\\ 6 & 12\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -22 \\\\ 6 & 18\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-38728/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "787173e1-f957-5ff0-9d14-a6ccb11de1d8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-38728"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
